      "writtenOn": "2022-04-12T15:37:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, Miklos Szeredi is the FUSE maintainer and gave a NACK. So I don\u0027t have any further arguments for the patch upstream. My thinking for the cherry-pick was that if we were to upstream these ANDROID patches Miklos would require us to use uint*_t types. 😞\n\nOtherwise I don\u0027t really know how to resolve the warning. Do we even want to?",
      "parentUuid": "019e592b_de65f5be",
      "revId": "92e19ce6cc059b74206b6fa53eeb2d705345da5c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
